Changes made in this derivative (halt95, 2026):
  - model-*.safetensors: rebuilt from halt95/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-W4A16-Merlin with the 300 tensors that Swift 1.5
    changed: attention q/k/v/o and shared-expert projections, kept in BF16; the GDN in_proj_qkv / in_proj_z /
    out_proj projections, re-packed to INT8 per-channel symmetric in the Merlin checkpoint's format. The routed
    experts, MTP head and PLE table are the Merlin checkpoint's, unmodified; the tensor-level comparison of Swift
    1.5 with Qwen3.8-Flash-Next reported them unchanged by Swift 1.5 (full SHA-256 hashes for the MTP head; shard
    or sampled hashes for the other unchanged groups).
  - model.safetensors.index.json: re-serialised; byte-identical to the Merlin checkpoint's index (27 weight files); weight_map
    unchanged.
  - qsa_kv_scales_swift.json: added to the checkpoint, and shipped in this repository as
    quant/kv_scales-swift-e4m3.json (the same bytes); static FP8 K/V scales recalibrated on this checkpoint. This
    file is model-derived data, not Apache-2.0: it is subject to the Swift Open License v1.0 (LICENSE-SWIFT in this
    repository) and the Qwen Community License 1.0 (LICENSE-QWEN in this repository), the same two licences as the
    checkpoint it was calibrated on.
  - This repository's README.md, CHANGELOG.md, NOTICE, docs/, benchmarks/, serve/serve.sh and release/: written
    for this checkpoint by halt95.
  - LICENSE-SWIFT (Swift Open License v1.0 text) and LICENSE-QWEN (Qwen Community License 1.0 text) are unchanged
    copies of the licence texts; LICENSE is the Apache License 2.0 text.
